{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S05、S13等段落里感受信息仍然偏密，而且个别叙述压缩或改写后，人物动机和心理转折不如Y交代得准确、连贯。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用加亮短语提供了明确的视觉落点，观众不用读完每句话就能抓住每段的情节核心；感受按音乐时点出现，也让声音变化、身体感觉和心理波动有了更具体的对应。Y的完整叙述在人物动机和前后心理转折上更稳，尤其是从害怕失去到愿意接受不确定的过程，讲得更自然。但作为边听边扫屏幕的普通观众，我更看重X能否让我及时抓住故事重点，同时真正感受到音乐细节，这方面X整体占优。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "48545165-368e-4b16-a51b-81c3760d788d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T061251731768Z", "elapsed_seconds": 104.86, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T06:14:36.603278+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9f6d706aa9bf164278951e023c738000b76a1cf40aaf0ef305d3e07e3a6a824d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\